cker's (Alice's) 1 share is now worth (queried via calculateAssets):\", aliceValue, \"HYBR\");\n        console.log(\"------------------------------------------\");\n        \n        assertEq(bobShares, 0);\n        assertEq(bobValue, 0);\n        assertLt(bobValue, bobDepositAmount);\n        assertEq(aliceValue, alicePoisonDeposit + bobDepositAmount);\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThe Test logs:\n```\nforge test --match-test test_Poc -vvv\n[⠊] Compiling...\n[⠑] Compiling 1 files with Solc 0.8.13\n[⠃] Compiling 1 files with Solc 0.8.13\n[⠊] Compiling 1 files with Solc 0.8.13\n[⠒] Compiling 1 files with Solc 0.8.13\n[⠑] Solc 0.8.13 finished in 158.64s\nCompiler run successful with warnings:\nRan 1 test for test/C4PoC.t.sol:C4PoC\n[PASS] test_Poc() (gas: 903125)\nLogs:\n  === Importing CL Contracts ===\n  Network: local\n    PoolFactory imported at: 0x961e384b66ae2Bb90c9bBdd3d5105397E70a7A37\n    PoolImplementation imported at: 0xcD95e0E356A5f414894Be4bAD363acdaCcAb30a9\n    NonfungiblePositionManager imported at: 0xC33F7eF76C2bBC678794516f038e62Ce3fAE6072\n    NftPositionDescriptor imported at: 0x41b343Df2196081e42ac8Da11a1aA38De08e8658\n    SwapRouter imported at: 0xd9cb6B79f518cBD42AAcd7d5Cb1FD355B5dF2953\n    Quoter imported at: 0x3368CC5DE817eF5b492792eF42c29a6b2746D036\n    SwapFeeModule imported at: 0x7a3CE1E2bF7dBbb4A1B3039Cc468a915b2596cA8\n    UnstakedFeeModule imported at: 0xD6D13a66c35d1a60556d955b0EBf5E2B32be4323\n    ProtocolFeeModule imported at: 0x6966CB5815014204E5bF64A851ef03cF93eA2D35\n  === CL Contracts Imported Successfully ===\n  \n  === Phase 1: Deploy Infrastructure ===\n  Deployer: 0x7FA9385bE102ac3EAc297483Dd6233D62b3e1496\n  ProxyAdmin: 0x5615dEB798BB3E4dFa0139dFa1b3D433Cc23b72f\n  PermissionsRegistry: 0x2e234DAe75C793f67A35089C9d99245E1C58470b\n  VeArtProxy: 0x5991A2dF15A8F6A256D3Ec51E99254Cd3fb576A9\n  TokenHandler: 0xc7183455a4C133Ae270771860664b6B7ec320bB1\n  \n=== Infrastructure Deployment Complete ===\n  === Phase 2: Deploy Token System ===\n  D